## Summary and Quick Reference

### Terminal Interaction Checklist

- [ ] Execute ONE command at a time
- [ ] Set TIMEOUTS for all commands (5s default, 30s for builds)
- [ ] Use BACKGROUND execution for dev servers
- [ ] RECOGNIZE success patterns instead of waiting for completion
- [ ] ASSUME success if no errors after timeout
- [ ] TRACK current directory and environment state
- [ ] USE platform-appropriate commands
- [ ] HANDLE errors gracefully with recovery strategies
- [ ] INTEGRATE with command system (/plan:decompose, /lint:all, etc.)
- [ ] MAINTAIN awareness of long-running processes

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid

- ❌ Waiting indefinitely for dev server completion
- ❌ Assuming command failed due to timeout
- ❌ Chaining commands with && in PowerShell
- ❌ Forgetting to background long-running processes
- ❌ Not checking for success indicators
- ❌ Ignoring partial output as failure

### Command System Quick Reference

| Task             | Command                     | Timeout/Background    |
| ---------------- | --------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Install deps     | `npm install`               | 30s timeout           |
| Start dev server | `npm run dev &`             | Background            |
| Run tests        | `timeout 30s npm test`      | 30s timeout           |
| Build project    | `timeout 30s npm run build` | 30s timeout           |
| Check port       | `lsof -i :3000`             | 5s timeout            |
| Plan feature     | `/plan:decompose`           | N/A                   |
| Run linter       | `/lint:all`                 | Uses internal timeout |
| Integration      | `/integrate`                | Uses internal checks  |

- [ ] LOG all operations for debugging
- [ ] VALIDATE state before and after operations
- [ ] RESPECT safety protocols for dangerous commands
- [ ] MAINTAIN awareness of long-running processes
